    "b);\nEND;\nEND;\n\nxsmvpp:=xsmvii;\nIF xsmvkind==0 THEN xsmvtotal:=xsmvsm*xsmvii; ELSE xsmvtotal:=xsmvcm*xsmvii; END;\nFOR xsm"+
